        "Send your messages one by one. Each message is sent separately to every DM.\n\n"
        "emoji_6120766436219555441 *Supported features:*\n"
        "• *Multiple messages* — send several, each delivered in order\n"
        "• *Images & files* — mix text and media freely\n"
        "• *No Link Preview* — disable the preview card before sending a link "
        "and the bot preserves that exact setting for every DM\n"
        "• *Reply chain* — after saving message 1, swipe-reply to it and send "
        "message 2; the bot will deliver message 2 as a real reply to message 1 "
        "in every DM, exactly as you composed it\n\n"
        f"{DIVIDER}\n"
